# LOG keeps LF everywhere. Every tool, test and hygiene sweep in this project treats a CR byte as a defect.
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true globally, which would rewrite the working copy to CRLF on the first
# clone and break that rule before a single line of work happened. These rules win over that setting.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.bin binary
*.gba binary
*.sav binary
*.ips binary
